note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note bf16 scale for one fp8 block. a is the f32 bit pattern of amax (non-negative).
note Zero returns the bf16 code of 1 (16256, 0x3F80). Otherwise amax/448 rounded
note up: any nonzero low 16 bits increments the high half. 448.0f32 bits 1138753536.
note WolframLanguageEvaluator: FromDigits of the Real32 bit list of 448 -> 1138753536.
fn av_fp8sc a ulong to ulong
if eq a 0
ret 16256
end
q = div bitcast f32 uint a bitcast f32 uint 1138753536
b = bitcast uint q
h = shr b 16
if ne and b 65535 0
h = add h 1
end
ret ulong and h 65535
end
